meta {
  name: Delete the confirmed placement
  type: http
  seq: 12
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/placements/{{placementId}}
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  X-School-Id: {{schoolCode}}
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 204
}

docs {
  The last thing pointing at the syllabus is gone, which is what folder 12
  needs: curriculum nodes restrict deletion while a placement names them, so a
  run that left this row behind would fail to tear down its own curriculum and
  leave the database dirty for the next one.

  Resolving the topic again from here answers unmapped with an empty content
  list -- a 200, not a 404. The node is real and nothing is mapped to it, which
  is an ordinary state for a syllabus point nobody has got to yet.
}
